data: {"type":"response.completed","sequence_number":2477,"response":{"id":"resp_01f00a726c27b4d0016adb322881a08191b7efb1e37228c596","object":"response","created_at":1792750120,"completed_at":1792750145,"status":"completed","background":false,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"presence_penalty":0.0,"moderation":null,"model":"gpt-6-luna","access_programs":null,"previous_response_id":null,"instructions":"Complete the supplied mathematical task using only its explicit inputs and tools. Submit the requested JSON artifact through submit_artifact. Tool feedback is real task feedback; do not invent a successful check. This is a Yui workflow stage. Read the relevant declared Yui rules, preserve the supplied proof route and exact allowed assumptions, and distinguish mathematical review from structural checks.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_01f00a726c27b4d0016adb322dfa908191b643890c456660b1","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABq2zItOOMcVetoixgT5l1CBHczzJK_1sh5I2iyovoq-I7W9Gc6lUmMFcQQBEtv71Q_qwzaL4wzs4hTxZEfbQemTxyv4rh8LAGfa8SEQ5r886DuuZMT0bNk7igfG_SxSeXsUuucsvc0SCi70-_rYJaGIzxkdOEASnNhLZjuZJ78oG73u29G5Cs06b29RzCVGEEFujxmyBZ0sdeBLmeDzPh5ZZnrZkXDJ2ClMlKYGisXEyLzTXMlmxRgBYguumas63N3X5kbFPVpHi1u6V5sqiHlMH5Raf2Qjfp-lOAwi2qI6ZG8iJlGfIhfV0IqN5uCSMijxNlllAB1rfBZz46fj9TAe7C5ndQK1aLD-bU7wAGJD5YpK3drqFJO6RFAWpUeaFs7h2sFgsXtU2bn2hlY54wO5EXob7whQvtgNKZUn8jbZQvu5h6RX2CJ9fUFZsPlJ_WoG-A10Zzc_7rv7Ux5TrjMfpeiWV6VWpS1_e4Pl_mepSKPRgD-hODk7YusUQNP-yE4m5oGypsHJX4Z-JsSsH8zXuwBgiMZbDRr8sJpMISXyzplK4r7jE89MrwMqEyNJrIfV7OSKRcI9KmF3JUjgMF93fZ7tyfBy04qexwttNL9hE8wLbAYxrw44GQvpAE_mRZ6SdJ4hIAG3CyIOZ5bkjFqkExOXwj8x9P63rIpXk1d7bi86Oo2MtJYMqXSOxQd7V_PB_w1KLTCyXDP1Xuams95eSQGT7fSGws7Cu74TyD4HDNwMsH064VtXzYvBxsUYkeaKYe8jOjOkrasSV7G92ps-5X8JgjBtoAZeQTyjbxoYOG71nf5R_ZyNvZz2pj1EHrdzeE9nJ_4vdMd6cepRErO4vdFrxL8_n74zCyMVjad_Aig9YvBSLB1H-KkkRlVdvu8P8eCyJu28o5r24Oe8No4AHKU7lPWb84T4xNZSRwJcL23u0lqgE7EpRYaZJF_yRRYdLxzmuzUS9yRvq_WRaNDTDRu-XJzgj06xhVG7hQMHGriZEiIAq_CTBDOKn0yl36nDO9XxELCsIiyVM3QWWPXcN-sG4O